# COBOL Knowledge Sources

## Purpose

This repository contains COBOL mentoring materials collected and refined during mentoring, training, onboarding and knowledge-sharing activities between 2022 and the present.

The repository serves as a source knowledge base for:

- COBOL education
- mentoring programs
- onboarding new developers
- AIMC experiments
- lesson generation
- exercise generation
- knowledge graph construction
- AI-assisted learning

This repository is the canonical source of COBOL-related knowledge and teaching materials.

---

# Repository Structure

## topics/

Topic-oriented learning materials.

Examples:

- introduction-to-cobol.md
- data-types.md
- file-handling.md
- control-statements.md
- subprograms.md
- db2.md
- cics.md
- modernization.md

