---

# Guiding Principles

The repository is organized around knowledge, not technology.

Materials may later be transformed into:

- AIMC lessons
- learning paths
- quizzes
- exercises
- mentor prompts
- knowledge graph nodes
- onboarding guides

The original source material should always be preserved.

Generated content can be recreated.
Source knowledge cannot.

